WEBVTT

1
00:00:09.534 --> 00:00:14.244
Izzie was bouncing to Kids Central.

2
00:00:14.245 --> 00:00:18.671
"Gurp, gurp, gurp," she croaked.

3
00:00:18.672 --> 00:00:21.646
She was thinking about her pet frog, Gurpy.

4
00:00:21.647 --> 00:00:29.637
He was at the vet today.

5
00:00:29.638 --> 00:00:33.480
Miss Shelly blew her whistle as Izzie walked in the gym.

6
00:00:33.481 --> 00:00:40.911
"Time to go outside!" the teacher called.

7
00:00:40.912 --> 00:00:45.321
"Today we're going to play hopscotch," Miss Shelly said.

8
00:00:45.322 --> 00:00:48.478
She had drawn a hopscotch board on the blacktop.

9
00:00:48.479 --> 00:00:51.129
Izzie bounced up and down.

10
00:00:51.130 --> 00:00:54.587
"We're going to hop, just like Gurpy!"

11
00:00:54.588 --> 00:00:59.248
"We're going to do more than just hop," Miss Shelly said.

12
00:00:59.249 --> 00:01:02.668
"This is a special game of hopscotch.

13
00:01:02.669 --> 00:01:06.533
You will all write an activity in each square.

14
00:01:06.534 --> 00:01:10.997
When you land in a square, you have to do that activity."

15
00:01:10.998 --> 00:01:15.677
"What kind of activities should we write?" Nina asked.

16
00:01:15.678 --> 00:01:18.711
"Something fun," Miss Shelly said.

17
00:01:18.712 --> 00:01:21.939
"Like ten jumping jacks!"

18
00:01:21.940 --> 00:01:25.400
"Or five push-ups?" Bobby asked.

19
00:01:25.401 --> 00:01:29.497
"Or spin around eight times?" Jason asked.

20
00:01:29.498 --> 00:01:32.550
"Exactly!" Miss Shelly said.

21
00:01:32.551 --> 00:01:39.700
"Grab a piece of chalk and fill in the blank squares."

22
00:01:39.701 --> 00:01:44.008
Izzie knew exactly what to write.

23
00:01:44.009 --> 00:01:48.539
When everyone was finished, they lined up behind Miss Shelly.

24
00:01:48.540 --> 00:01:51.155
Miss Shelly held up a beanbag.

25
00:01:51.156 --> 00:01:55.319
"To start, toss this beanbag onto a square.

26
00:01:55.320 --> 00:01:58.097
Hop to the square on one foot.

27
00:01:58.098 --> 00:02:01.336
If you hop on a line, you are out!

28
00:02:01.337 --> 00:02:04.494
When you get to the square, do the activity.

29
00:02:04.495 --> 00:02:08.773
If you can't do the activity, you're out."

30
00:02:08.774 --> 00:02:13.762
"I'll go first!" Izzie blurted out.

31
00:02:13.763 --> 00:02:17.287
Izzie tossed the beanbag.

32
00:02:17.288 --> 00:02:20.031
She hopped to where it landed.

33
00:02:20.032 --> 00:02:23.052
"Six push-ups," she read.

34
00:02:23.053 --> 00:02:27.672
"That's mine!" Bobby said proudly.

35
00:02:27.673 --> 00:02:34.374
"One, two, three, four, five, six."

36
00:02:34.375 --> 00:02:37.728
Everyone counted as Izzie did her push-ups.

37
00:02:37.729 --> 00:02:40.622
"Yay!" Nina cheered.

38
00:02:40.623 --> 00:02:42.609
She was next.

39
00:02:42.610 --> 00:02:46.555
She hopped to her square.

40
00:02:46.556 --> 00:02:48.880
"Five frog jumps?

41
00:02:48.881 --> 00:02:51.818
This must be yours, Izzie.

42
00:02:51.819 --> 00:02:54.337
What's a frog jump?"

43
00:02:54.338 --> 00:02:58.949
Izzie giggled. "It's when you jump like Gurpy!"

44
00:02:58.950 --> 00:03:04.399
She squatted down and then jumped and moved forward. "Like this!"

45
00:03:04.400 --> 00:03:06.828
Nina's face turned red.

46
00:03:06.829 --> 00:03:10.780
"Do I have to?" She turned to Miss Shelly.

47
00:03:10.781 --> 00:03:15.065
Miss Shelly nodded. "It's part of the game."

48
00:03:15.066 --> 00:03:18.925
"Otherwise you'll be out," Ethan said.

49
00:03:18.926 --> 00:03:24.174
"When you do them, it brings good luck for frogs," Izzie said.

50
00:03:24.175 --> 00:03:26.052
Everyone looked at Izzie.

51
00:03:26.053 --> 00:03:28.808
"Really?" asked Jason.

52
00:03:28.809 --> 00:03:31.839
"I think so," Izzie answered.

53
00:03:31.840 --> 00:03:36.653
Nina sighed and did five little frog jumps.

54
00:03:36.654 --> 00:03:41.858
"Yay! Those were perfect frog jumps!" Izzie cheered.

55
00:03:41.859 --> 00:03:43.859
Ethan was next.

56
00:03:43.860 --> 00:03:46.149
He had to do a cartwheel.

57
00:03:46.150 --> 00:03:50.396
Bobby spun around ten times.

58
00:03:50.397 --> 00:03:53.404
Jason did the crabwalk for one minute.

59
00:03:53.405 --> 00:03:55.993
Then they all took another turn.

60
00:03:55.994 --> 00:04:01.540
Soon it was time to go back inside.

61
00:04:01.541 --> 00:04:05.459
"How is Gurpy doing?" Miss Shelly asked.

62
00:04:05.460 --> 00:04:07.338
Izzie looked down.

63
00:04:07.339 --> 00:04:09.416
"He's at the vet.

64
00:04:09.417 --> 00:04:12.421
He wasn't eating," she said.

65
00:04:12.422 --> 00:04:15.433
"Oh, Izzie, I'm sorry.

66
00:04:15.434 --> 00:04:18.857
I hope he's okay," Miss Shelly said.

67
00:04:18.858 --> 00:04:22.531
Izzie nodded. "Me too."

68
00:04:22.532 --> 00:04:25.769
Just then Izzie's mom arrived.

69
00:04:25.770 --> 00:04:28.784
"Mom!" Izzie called.

70
00:04:28.785 --> 00:04:31.045
"Good news, sweetie.

71
00:04:31.046 --> 00:04:33.954
Gurpy ate five worms today.

72
00:04:33.955 --> 00:04:38.042
Everything is okay!" her mom said happily.

73
00:04:38.043 --> 00:04:41.697
Izzie jumped up and hugged Nina.

74
00:04:41.698 --> 00:04:52.049
"I knew those frog jumps would work! Thanks, Nina."
